 is het de enige instelling in zijn soort in Belgi\u00eb en het buitenland. De permanente collectie, die enkel op afspraak te bezichtigen is, bevat meer dan 3000 kunstbindingen van de 16de tot de 21ste eeuw. Wittockiana organiseert ongeveer vier tijdelijke tentoonstellingen per jaar over boekbinden en boekenkunsten.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Bibliotheca Wittockiana","address_street_name":"Rue du Bemel","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@wittockiana.org","website":"http:\/\/www.wittockiana.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 770 53 33","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1150","address_city":"Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","address_line1":"Rue du Bemel, 23","address_line2":"1150 Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","description_web":"A private collection of bookbindings from the Renaissance and expanded to include contemporary examples.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Bibliotheca Wittockiana: Msueum f\u00fcr Buch- und Buchbindekunst","address_street_name":"Rue du Bemel","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@wittockiana.org","website":"http:\/\/www.wittockiana.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 770 53 33","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1150","address_city":"Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","address_line1":"Rue du Bemel, 23","address_line2":"1150 Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","description_web":"Die Bibliotheca Wittockiana wurde 1983 von dem renommierten Buchkenners Michel Wittock gegr\u00fcndet und ist sowohl Buchmuseum als auch Bibliothek und Archiv f\u00fcr kostbare historische, moderne und zeitgen\u00f6ssische B\u00fccher.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Bibliotheca Wittockiana : Mus\u00e9e des Arts du livre et de la Reliure","address_street_name":"Rue du Bemel","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@wittockiana.org","website":"htt