,"date_start":"2022-09-16","date_end":"2022-11-05","is_also_by_appointment":false}],"prices":[],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":{"list":[255,261,263,266],"translations":{"fr":["Accessible","Parking accessible","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"nl":["Toegankelijk","Toegankelijke parking","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"en":["Accessible","Accessible parking","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Brussels Health Safety Label"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-10-23T02:05:56+02:00","published_at":"2022-07-05T09:06:23+02:00","backoffice_id":257752,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.33974515584373},{"id":538988,"date_start":"2022-09-17","date_end":"2022-11-06","date_next":"2022-10-25","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":true,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":true,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":102,"translations":{"fr":"Visites Guid\u00e9es","nl":"Begeleide rondleidingen","en":"Guided tours","de":"Stadtf\u00fchrungen"}},"others":{"list":[251],"translations":{"fr":["Art Contemporain "],"nl":["Hedendaagse Kunst"],"en":["Contemporary Art"],"de":["Zeitgen\u00f6ssische Kunst "]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Expo \u00ab Couleur\/Lumi\u00e8re \u00bb: visites guid\u00e9es avec ou sans ateliers cr\u00e9atifs","shortdescr":"Visites guid\u00e9es avec ou sans ateliers cr\u00e9atifs dans le cadre de l'exposition \"Couleur\/Lumi\u00e8re\" \u00e0 la Maison des Arts.","longdescr":"Dans le cadre de l'exposition \"Couleur\/Lumi\u00e8re\", la Maison des Arts vous propose une visite guid\u00e9e pouvant \u00eatre suivie de l\u2019atelier de votre choix.\r\n\r\nDans Couleur\/Lumi\u00e8re, dix artistes pr\u00e9sentent des \u0153uvres d\u00e9fiant nos perceptions, utilisant les couleurs et la lumi\u00e8re pour cr\u00e9er des exp\u00e9riences d\u00e9concertantes, repenser notre relation \u00e0 l\u2019espace et \u00e0 l\u2019architecture, et remettre en question la soci\u00e9t\u00e9 dans laquelle nous vivons. Ces artistes \u00e9tablis aussi bien qu\u2019\u00e9mergents investissent les espaces de la Maison des Arts, tant\u00f4t en la transformant, tant\u00f4t en cr\u00e9ant de subtils moments de surprise, pour le plaisir des yeux et la subversion des sens.\r\n\r\nLa visite peut \u00eatre accompagn\u00e9e d'un atelier de votre choix:\r\n\r\nAtelier 1 : COLORS + 3 ans\r\n\r\nD\u00e9couvrons le fascinant m\u00e9lange des couleurs en confectionnant un mini livre aux couleurs changeantes\u2026\r\n\r\nAtelier 2 : SHADOWS + 6 ans\r\n\r\nEn cr\u00e9ant de petites figurines de papier articul\u00e9es, explorons ensemble le monde myst\u00e9rieux des ombres.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nINFOS PRATIQUES\r\nR\u00e9servation obligatoire\r\n\r\nQuand? Du mardi au vendredi de 9h \u00e0 16h et le week-end de 11h \u00e0 17h.\r\nR\u00e9servations: 3 semaines \u00e0 l\u2019avance. \r\nAnnulation: Dans un d\u00e9lai de 15 jours avant la date r\u00e9serv\u00e9e sinon la facture sera due. \r\nNombre de personnes: min.5 - max. 20\r\nLangue: FR\/NL \r\nTarif : En semaine : visite 65\u20ac \/ visite + atelier 90\u20ac\r\n          Le week-end : visite 70\u20ac\/ visite + atelier 135\u20ac\r\n\r\nPour r\u00e9server, merci d\u2019envoyer un mail \u00e0 reservationsma@1030.be avec les informations suivantes :\r\n\r\n    Nom du groupe\r\n    Langue de la visite\r\n    Gsm\r\n    Date + heure souhait\u00e9e\r\n    Nombre d\u2019adultes et d\u2019enfants + \u00e2ges des enfants\r\n    Activit\u00e9 souhait\u00e9e : visite simple (1h), visite + atelier (2h) \u2013 pr\u00e9ciser l\u2019atelier \r\n\r\nPhoto: Elina Salminen, Circles I (c)Antoine Doetsch","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/lamaisondesarts.be\/visites-guidees-avec-ou-sans-ateliers-creatifs-3\/","email":"reservationsma@1030.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538988"},"nl":{"name":"Tentoonstelling \u201cKleur\/Licht\u201d: rondleidingen met of zonder creatieve workshops","shortdescr":"Rondleidingen met of zonder creatieve workshops in het kader van de tentoonstelling \u201cKleur\/Licht\u201d in la Maison des Arts","longdescr":"Een rondleiding van de tentoonstelling \"Kleur\/Licht\" gevolgd door de workshop van je keuze.\r\n\r\nIn Kleur\/Licht presenteren tien kunstenaars werken die onze perceptie op de proef stellen.  Ze gebruiken kleuren en licht om bevreemdende ervaringen op te wekken, ons te doen stilstaan bij onze relatie tot ruimte en architectuur, en onze maatschappij in vraag te stellen. Gevestigde en opkomende kunstenaars transformeren de ruimtes van La Maison des Arts en cre\u00ebren er subtiele verrassingsmomenten, tot groot genoegen van onze ogen en andere zintuigen.\r\n\r\nHet bezoek kan vergezeld gaan van een workshop naar keuze:\r\n\r\nAtelier 1 : COLORS + 3 jaar\r\n\r\nMaak een boekje met veranderende kleuren en ontdek een fascinerende kleurenmix.\r\n\r\nAtelier 2 : SHADOWS + 6 jaar\r\n\r\nWe maken bewegende papieren figuurtjes en verkennen samen de mysterieuze wereld van schaduwen.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nINFO\r\nReservatie verplicht\r\n\r\nWanneer? Dinsdag tot vrijdag van 9u tot 16u en Weekends van 11u tot 17u\r\nReservatie: 3 weken op voorhand \r\nAnnulatie: Binnen 15 dagen voor de geboekte datum, anders is de factuur verschuldigd \r\nAantal personen: min.5 - max. 20\r\nTaal: FR\/NL \r\nTarief : Weekdagen: bezoek 65\u20ac \/ bezoek + workshop 90\u20ac\r\n            Weekend: bezoek 70\u20ac \/ bezoek + workshop 135\u20ac\r\n\r\nOm te reserveren, stuur een e-mail naar reservationsma@1030.be  met de volgende informatie :\r\n\r\n\u2013 Naam van de groep\r\n\u2013 Taal\r\n\u2013 Gsm\r\n\u2013 Datum + gewenste tijd\r\n\u2013 Aantal volwassenen en kinderen + leeftijd van de kinderen\r\n\u2013 Gewenste activiteit: Rondleiding (1u), rondleiding + creatieve workshop (2u)\r\n\r\nFoto: Elina Salminen, Circles (c)Antoine Doetsch","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538988"},"en":{"name":"Expo \u00ab Couleur\/Lumi\u00e8re \u00bb: visites guid\u00e9es avec ou sans ateliers cr\u00e9atifs","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538988"},"de":{"name":"Expo \u00ab Couleur\/Lumi\u00e8re \u00bb: visites guid\u00e9es avec ou sans ateliers cr\u00e9atifs","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538988"},"it":{"name":"Expo \u00ab Couleur\/Lumi\u00e8re \u00bb: visites guid\u00e9es avec ou sans ateliers cr\u00e9atifs","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538988"},"sp":{"name":"Expo \u00ab Couleur\/Lumi\u00e8re \u00bb: visites guid\u00e9es avec ou sans ateliers cr\u00e9atifs","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538988"},"pt":{"name":"Expo \u00ab Couleur\/Lumi\u00e8re \u00bb: visites guid\u00e9es avec ou sans ateliers cr\u00e9atifs","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538988"},"cn":{"name":"Expo \u00ab Couleur\/Lumi\u00e8re \u00bb: visites guid\u00e9es avec ou sans ateliers cr\u00e9atifs","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538988"}},"place":{"id":222932,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"La Maison des Arts, anim\u00e9e par le Service Culture fran\u00e7aise de la Commune de Schaerbeek, est un espace singulier dont les activit\u00e9s sont principalement ax\u00e9es sur la cr\u00e9ation contemporaine dans le domaine des arts plastiques avec un important programme de m\u00e9diation permettant l\u2019acc\u00e8s de l\u2019art contemporain \u00e0 tous.\r\n\r\nLa MA conna\u00eet une riche activit\u00e9 artistique depuis les ann\u00e9es \u201950, \u00e9poque \u00e0 laquelle la commune rach\u00e8te le b\u00e2timent. En 2005, elle se voit prendre un premier tournant en proposant aux artistes de travailler in situ, afin d\u2019\u00e9tablir une r\u00e9elle coh\u00e9rence entre l\u2019\u0153uvre et la Maison.\r\nEt finalement, c\u2019est en 2016 que la Commune de Schaerbeek d\u00e9cide de la positionner dans le domaine des arts plastiques, contemporains et num\u00e9riques comme un lieu de cr\u00e9ation, de diffusion et de rayonnement culturel.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Huis der Kunsten","address_street_name":"Haachtsesteenweg","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaarbeek","address_line1":"Haachtsesteenweg, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaarbeek","description_web":"La Maison des Arts, geanimeerd door de dienst Franstalige Cultuur van de gemeente Schaarbeek, is een heel bijzondere plek. De activiteiten zijn vooral gericht op hedendaagse creativiteit in de plastische kunsten.\r\n\r\nIn La Maison des Arts heerst reeds sedert 1950 ( datum waarop de gemeente het huis aankocht) een ruime artistieke activiteit. In 2005 is er een belangrijke ontwikkeling : het voorstel aan de kunstenaars om ter plaatse te werken, teneinde een echte samenhang te bereiken tussen het werk en het Huis. Uiteindelijk beslist de Gemeente Schaarbeek er een echte broeikast van te maken in het domein van de beeldende kunsten, een bron van schepping, verspreiding en culturele uitstraling.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"The MdA is run and staffed by the Francophone Cultural Service of Schaerbeek Council and is a unique place whose activities are mainly concerned with the creation of works of contemporary art with a significant partnership programme that promotes access for all to contemporary art.\r\n\r\nThe MdA has hosted a rich programme of artistic activities since the 1950s when the building was purchased by Schaerbeek Council. In 2005, the MdA began a programme of inviting artists to work in building, to build more coherence between their works of art and the MdA.\r\n\r\nMost recently, in 2016, Schaerbeek Council decided to position the MdA as a centre for the creation, diffusion and promotion of culture, contemporary two-dimensional, three-dimensional and digital art.\r\nThe MdA\u2019s educational and social approach aims to promoting equality of access to art and its introduction to new audiences.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":[],"zones":{"list":[20],"translations":{"fr":["Nord"],"nl":["Noord"],"en":["North"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":663,"location":{"lat":50.85951067,"lon":4.37063079},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-10-24T01:36:50+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:42+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":222932,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"La Maison des Arts, anim\u00e9e par le Service Culture fran\u00e7aise de la Commune de Schaerbeek, est un espace singulier dont les activit\u00e9s sont principalement ax\u00e9es sur la cr\u00e9ation contemporaine dans le domaine des arts plastiques avec un important programme de m\u00e9diation permettant l\u2019acc\u00e8s de l\u2019art contemporain \u00e0 tous.\r\n\r\nLa MA conna\u00eet une riche activit\u00e9 artistique depuis les ann\u00e9es \u201950, \u00e9poque \u00e0 laquelle la commune rach\u00e8te le b\u00e2timent. En 2005, elle se voit prendre un premier tournant en proposant aux artistes de travailler in situ, afin d\u2019\u00e9tablir une r\u00e9elle coh\u00e9rence entre l\u2019\u0153uvre et la Maison.\r\nEt finalement, c\u2019est en 2016 que la Commune de Schaerbeek d\u00e9cide de la positionner dans le domaine des arts plastiques, contemporains et num\u00e9riques comme un lieu de cr\u00e9ation, de diffusion et de rayonnement culturel.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Huis der Kunsten","address_street_name":"Haachtsesteenweg","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaarbeek","address_line1":"Haachtsesteenweg, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaarbeek","description_web":"La Maison des Arts, geanimeerd door de dienst Franstalige Cultuur van de gemeente Schaarbeek, is een heel bijzondere plek. De activiteiten zijn vooral gericht op hedendaagse creativiteit in de plastische kunsten.\r\n\r\nIn La Maison des Arts heerst reeds sedert 1950 ( datum waarop de gemeente het huis aankocht) een ruime artistieke activiteit. In 2005 is er een belangrijke ontwikkeling : het voorstel aan de kunstenaars om ter plaatse te werken, teneinde een echte samenhang te bereiken tussen het werk en het Huis. Uiteindelijk beslist de Gemeente Schaarbeek er een echte broeikast van te maken in het domein van de beeldende kunsten, een bron van schepping, verspreiding en culturele uitstraling.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"The MdA is run and staffed by the Francophone Cultural Service of Schaerbeek Council and is a unique place whose activities are mainly concerned with the creation of works of contemporary art with a significant partnership programme that promotes access for all to contemporary art.\r\n\r\nThe MdA has hosted a rich programme of artistic activities since the 1950s when the building was purchased by Schaerbeek Council. In 2005, the MdA began a programme of inviting artists to work in building, to build more coherence between their works of art and the MdA.\r\n\r\nMost recently, in 2016, Schaerbeek Council decided to position the MdA as a centre for the creation, diffusion and promotion of culture, contemporary two-dimensional, three-dimensional and digital art.\r\nThe MdA\u2019s educational and social approach aims to promoting equality of access to art and its introduction to new audiences.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":n