ingen","en":"Exhibition","de":"Ausstellung"}},"others":{"list":[36,46],"translations":{"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers","Pluridisciplinaire"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra","Multidisciplinair"],"en":["Museums and art centers","Multidisciplinary"],"de":["Museen & Kunstzentren","Multidisziplin\u00e4r"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"\u00ab Petits mondes illustr\u00e9s \u00bb","shortdescr":"Pour cette exposition autour du conte jeunesse, le Centre Culturel de Schaerbeek met en avant le travail de cinq illustratrices bruxelloises.","longdescr":"Venez d\u00e9couvrir cinq univers singuliers fait de motifs, de trames, d\u2019aplats et de traits tant\u00f4t en couleur tant\u00f4t en noir et blanc. Des dessins originaux qui vous feront entrer dans des mondes color\u00e9s, habit\u00e9s de personnages po\u00e9tiques. Collage, aquarelle, s\u00e9rigraphie, feutres, \u2026 une diversit\u00e9 de techniques sera expos\u00e9e au Centre Culturel.\r\nDu dessin au conte, c\u2019est l\u2019occasion de d\u00e9couvrir les multiples \u00e9tapes de cr\u00e9ation d\u2019un livre.\r\nVenez voir cette exposition tout en histoire, en dessin et en couleur\u00a0!","performers":"No\u00e9lia Diaz Iglesias, No\u00e9mie Favart, Marie Mahler, \u00c9milie Seron et Mathilde Vandenbussche","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.culture1030.be\/","email":"info@culture1030.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 27 25","phone_booking":"+32 2 245 27 25","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539831"},"nl":{"name":"\u00ab Petits mondes illustr\u00e9s \u00bb","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539831"},"en":{"name":"\u00ab Petits mondes illustr\u00e9s \u00bb","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"em