recherche, d\u00e9bats politiques et \u00e9v\u00e9nements organis\u00e9es avec la soci\u00e9t\u00e9 civile, ainsi qu\u2019\u00e0 des expositions suscitant la r\u00e9flexion, le tout en libre acc\u00e8s au c\u0153ur du quartier europ\u00e9en. Avec des espaces distincts donnant acc\u00e8s \u00e0 une vari\u00e9t\u00e9 de contenus et d'activit\u00e9s, l\u2019Info Hub de l\u2019Esplanade Solidarno\u015b\u0107 1980 r\u00e9pond \u00e0 toute une gamme de besoins. Participez au dialogue sur l\u2019Union europ\u00e9enne et la d\u00e9mocratie, assistez \u00e0 des d\u00e9bats politiques, ou asseyez-vous et lisez tout simplement pour en apprendre davantage sur l\u2019actualit\u00e9 en Europe. Le programme \u00e9v\u00e9nementiel est en constante \u00e9volution, et vous permet ainsi de revenir autant de fois que vous le voulez en d\u00e9couvrant quelque chose de nouveau \u00e0 chaque visite. \r\n\r\nUne question ? Posez-la \u00e0 notre \u00e9quipe toujours pr\u00eate \u00e0 vous aider, et elle vous guidera dans l\u2019Info Hub ou sur le campus du Parlement europ\u00e9en.  ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Info Hub","address_street_name":"Esplanade Solidarnosc 1980","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/visiting.europarl.europa.eu\/nl\/visitor-offer\/brussels\/info-hub","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Esplanade Solidarnosc 1980","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"Verdiep u in onderwerpen die u interesseren via vrij toegankelijk onderzoeksmateriaal, beleidsbesprekingen, evenementen van het maatschappelijk middenveld en boeiende tentoonstellingen in het hart van de Europese wijk. Het aan de Esplanade Solidarno\u015b\u0107 1980 gelegen Info Hub biedt uiteenlopende activiteiten en diverse ruimten die ieder in een andere behoefte voorzien. Wissel van gedachten over de Europese Unie en democratie, woon een korte beleidsbespreking bij of neem rustig plaats om u in te lezen over wat er in Europa speelt. Dankzij de voortdurend wisselende evenementen en tentoonstellingen kunt u keer op keer terugkomen en telkens weer iets nieuws ontdekken.\r\n\r\nVragen? Onze medewerkers staan voor u klaar. Ze maken u graag wegwijs in het Info Hub of op het terrein van het Europees Parlement.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Info Hub","address_street_name":"Esplanade Solidarnosc 1980","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/visiting.europarl.europa.eu\/en\/visitor-offer\/brussels\/info-hub","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Esplanade Solidarnosc 1980","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Dive into the topics you are interested in with open access research material, policy talks and civil society events, and thought-provoking exhibitions at the heart of the European Quarter. With distinct areas offering access to a variety of content and activities, the Info Hub on the Esplanade Solidarno\u015b\u0107 1980 caters to many needs. Engage in a dialogue on the European Union and democracy, attend a short policy talk, or simply sit and read more about what is going on in Europe. What is more, with a constantly changing programme of events and exhibitions, you can come back time and time again, and discover something new each time.\r\n\r\nGot a question? Ask the friendly staff and they will help you find your way around the Info Hub, or the European Parliament campus.  ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Info Hub","address_street_name":"Esplanade Solidarnosc 1980","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/visiting.europarl.europa.eu\/fr\/visitor-offer\/brussels\/info-hub","phone_c