res et d\u00e9couvrez une ville en savourant ses d\u00e9licieuses sp\u00e9cialit\u00e9s !","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Discover Belgium","address_street_name":"Dieudonn\u00e9 Lef\u00e8vrestraat","address_street_number":"4","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@discover-belgium.be","website":"http:\/\/www.discover-belgium.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 227 46 75","phone_booking":"+32 477 45 52 97","address_zip":"1020","address_city":"Laken","address_line1":"Dieudonn\u00e9 Lef\u00e8vrestraat, 4","address_line2":"1020 Laken","description_web":"Ben je op zoek naar een leuk event dat mensen dichterbij brengt door samen te ontdekken, te genieten en te proeven?\r\n\r\nDiscover Belgium is je ideale partner met een aanbod van evenementen op maat in heel Belgi\u00eb. \r\n\r\nSterke punten:\r\n\r\nUitstekende professionele service van A tot Z\r\nPersoonlijke aanpak\r\nGespecialiseerd in Brussel, maar gecertificeerde concepten in heel Belgi\u00eb\r\n\r\nProef hun culinaire wandelingen en ontdek een stad door lekker te eten en te drinken! ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Discover Belgium","address_street_name":"Rue Dieudonn\u00e9 Lef\u00e8vre","address_street_number":"4","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@discover-belgium.be","website":"http:\/\/www.discover-belgium.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 227 46 75","phone_booking":"+32 477 45 52 97","address_zip":"1020","address_city":"Laeken","address_line1":"Rue Dieudonn\u00e9 Lef\u00e8vre, 4","address_line2":"1020 Laeken","description_web":"Are you looking for a fun event that brings people closer together by enjoying, discovering & tasting ? \r\n\r\nTheir advantages:\r\n\r\nExcellent professional service from A to Z\t\r\nPersonal approach\t\r\nSpecialized in Brussels but certified concepts in whole Belgium\r\n\r\nDiscover Belgium is your ideal partner by offering tailor-made events with experimented gui