description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[7],"translations":{"fr":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"nl":["Sint-Gillis centrum"],"en":["Saint-Gilles Centre"]}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"fr":["Sud"],"nl":["Zuid"],"en":["South"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":19493,"location":{"lat":50.82255979,"lon":4.3515514},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-10-11T02:06:41+02:00","published_at":"2014-10-19T18:10:40+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":false,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":238111,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"MAF - Mus\u00e9e d'Art Fantastique","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 7","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Bruxelles est fantastique ! Ce mus\u00e9e, l'un des plus atypique de Bruxelles, pr\u00e9sente des pi\u00e8ces de diff\u00e9rentes g\u00e9n\u00e9rations qui ont toutes un point commun avec le fantastique, l\u2019\u00e9trange ou le surr\u00e9alisme. Sa collection m\u00e9lange de nombreuses techniques et invite \u00e0 l\u2019imaginaire et au voyage. C\u2019est \u00e0 la mani\u00e8re d\u2019un cabinet de curiosit\u00e9s que le mus\u00e9e propose aux visiteurs une balade fantasque et unique. Pass\u00e9s \u00e0 la moulinette du troisi\u00e8me mill\u00e9naire, Bosch, Breughel, Delvaux, Magritte, Herg\u00e9 ou Rops ne renieraient sans doute pas cet endroit fantasmagorique en plein coeur de Bruxelles !","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Museum voor Fantastische Kunst","address_street_name":"Amerikastraat","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Sint-Gillis","address_line1":"Amerikastraat, 7","address_line2":"1060 Sint-Gillis","description_web":"Brussel is fantastisch! In een herenhuis in de Amerikaansestraat, op enkele stappen van het Hortamuseum, bevindt zich het Museum voor Fantastische Kunst. Het MAF kwam er op initiatief van Michel Dircken. De compleet atypische collectie ontsluit stukken van verschillende generaties die allemaal gerelateerd zijn aan de fantasiewereld, het bizarre of surrealisme, waarbij alle kunstvormen aan bod komen. Het staat buiten kijf dat kunstenaars als Bosch, Breughel, Delvaux, Magritte, Herg\u00e9 of Rops deze plek nooit hadden willen missen.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Fantastic Art Museum","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 7","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Brussels is fantastic! This museum, one of the most atypical of Brussels, presents pieces of different generations which all link to the fantastic, the strange or surrealism. Its collection mixes many techniques and invites on a journey through the imaginary. Conceived as a cabinet of curiosities, the museum is sure to offer visitors a fantastic and unique walkthrough. As would Bosch, Breughel, Delvaux, Magritte, Herg\u00e9 or Rops, you will not be able to ignore this spooky place in the heart of Brussels!","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"MAF - Mus\u00e9e d'Art Fantastique","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 7","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Die st\u00e4ndige Sammlung des Museums f\u00fcr Fantastische Kunst umfasst Werke und Exponate aus unterschiedlichen Epochen, deren gemeinsamer Nenner das Fantastische, das Seltsame oder das Surrealistische ist. Diese absolut atypische Sammlung mischt s\u00e4mtliche Techniken: plastische Kunst, Malerei, Bildhauerei...","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"MAF - Mus\u00e9e d'Art Fantastique","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 7","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"MAF - Museo de Arte Fant\u00e1stico","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 7","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La colecci\u00f3n permanente del Museo de Arte Fant\u00e1stico posee art\u00edculos de diferentes \u00e9pocas: todos tienen algo en com\u00fan con la fantas\u00eda, lo extra\u00f1o y lo surrealista. Esta colecci\u00f3n completamente at\u00edpica mezcla todas las t\u00e9cnicas: artes visuales, pintura y escultura.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"MAF - Mus\u00e9e d'Art Fantastique","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 7","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"MAF - Mus\u00e9e d'Art Fantastique","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 7","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":1925,"location":{"lat":50.82438824,"lon":4.35482215},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-10-11T02:06:41+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:14:45+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/f80064ca47029abd84614eef77e5b3832cae6a13.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080,"ratio":1.78,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"Halloween Tram","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"Halloween Tram","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"Halloween Tram","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2022-10-28","doors":"18:30:00","start":"18:30:00","end":"20:30:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":12}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[4,5,11,7,8],"translations":{"fr":["Enfants 6-9 ans","Enfants 9-12 ans","Famille","Jeunes 12-15 ans","Jeunes 15-18 ans"],"nl":["Kinderen 6-9 j.","Kinderen 9-12 j.","Familie","Jongeren 12-15 j.","Jongeren 15-18 j."],"en":["Children 6-9 yr.","Children 9-12 yr.","Family","Youth 12-15  yr.","Youth 15-18  yr."]}},"tags":["kids"],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-10-11T02:06:41+02:00","published_at":"2022-09-09T14:41:20+02:00","backoffice_id":261463,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"other","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1},{"id":538292,"date_start":"2022-10-28","date_end":"2022-10-29","date_next":"2022-10-28","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":49,"translations":{"fr":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","nl":"Theater","en":"Theatre","de":"Theater"}},"others":{"list":[50],"translations":{"fr":["Th\u00e9\u00e2tre"],"nl":["Theater"],"en":["Theatre"],"de":["Theater"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Nous avons cru \u00e0 l'amour qu'il a pour nous","shortdescr":"Savoir se taire, \u00e9touffer, r\u00e9primer, agir dans l\u2019ombre, toujours, pour acc\u00e9der \u00e0 un peu de libert\u00e9, pour ouvrir la voie. Tel fut le combat d\u2019une m\u00e8re, dont la fille, aujourd\u2019hui dans la quarantaine, va red\u00e9couvrir son pays natal, la Tunisie alors en proie \u00e0 une r\u00e9volution. Un printemps agit\u00e9 qui fait \u00e9cho \u00e0 son chambardement int\u00e9rieur.","longdescr":"Voici le point de d\u00e9part de ce r\u00e9cit qui se d\u00e9roule des deux c\u00f4t\u00e9s de la M\u00e9diterran\u00e9e et o\u00f9 se tressent les souvenirs d\u2019enfance \u00e0 Tunis, la famille, l\u2019\u00e9ducation, les oublis, les d\u00e9nis, un pass\u00e9 colonial enfoui, un \u00ab domptage \u00bb r\u00e9ussi.\r\n\r\nEn filigrane, la France aussi, sa langue, sa culture, ses id\u00e9aux, sa promesse de libert\u00e9 et son cort\u00e8ge d\u2019ambigu\u00eft\u00e9s. L\u2019actrice et auteure pose un regard sans concession sur sa condition de femme, ses petits arrangements, ses d\u00e9missions et ses d\u00e9pendances. \r\n\r\nOlivier Boudon met en sc\u00e8ne avec efficacit\u00e9 ce pan de vie relat\u00e9 dans une \u00e9criture directe et dense qui joue habilement avec les asp\u00e9rit\u00e9s de la m\u00e9moire et la temporalit\u00e9 de l\u2019action. \r\n\r\nMeissoune Majri engrange ici une des plus belles victoires : faire du carrefour de sa condition le r\u00e9cit d\u2019une richesse dans la compr\u00e9hension de soi et des autres.","performers":"Texte et interpr\u00e9tation : Meissoune Majri | Mise en sc\u00e8ne : Olivier Boudon | Aide \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9criture : Bernard Breuse | Son : Loup Mormont | Lumi\u00e8re : R\u00e9my Brans | Sc\u00e9nographie : Olivier Boudon | Vid\u00e9o et photographie : H\u00e9la Ammar | Costume : Carine Duarte | Diffusion: La Charge du Rhinoc\u00e9ros.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.espacemagh.be","email":"reservation@espacemagh.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 05 10","phone_booking":"+32 2 274 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538292"},"nl":{"name":"Nous avons cru \u00e0 l'amour qu'il a pour nous","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.538292"},"en":{"name":"Nous avons cru \u00e0 l'amour qu'il a pour nous","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":