2583\u2583\u2583\r\n\u25bc Gewoon feest \/ Tijd: vanaf 22.30 uur\r\n+ VIP TAFEL RESERVERING: info@alicerestaurant.be of +3226477044\r\nGraag vermelden : VIP TAFEL + naam + aantal personen +\r\nuw aankomsttijd\u25bc\r\n\u25bc Diner mogelijkheid door Alice\r\nTijd 19:30 Diner mogelijkheid onder reservatie - Speciaal MENU VOOR 54\u20ac (reservatie +3226477044 of info@alicerestaurant.be\r\nGraag vermelden : Diner TAFEL + naam + aantal personen +\r\nuw aankomsttijd\u25bc\r\n\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\r\n\u25bc ADRES \u25bc\r\nAdres: Louizalaan 190\r\nDatum: zaterdag 29 oktober 2022\r\n\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\r\n\u25bc JURK CODE \u25bc\r\nSmart Casual of Halloween-stijl\r\n\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\r\nUw toegewijde team:\r\nGewoon een nacht en Alice","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544385"},"en":{"name":"Terror in the City  \u2022 Pre-Halloween  | Free International Party","shortdescr":"Terror in the City - Pr\u00e9-Halloween edition at ALICE BAR\r\nOn Saturday 29.10 ===> BRUSSELS MAIN EVENT\r\nInternational Party\r\nFREE ENTRANCE","longdescr":"Terror in the City - Pr\u00e9-Halloween edition at ALICE BAR\r\nOn Saturday 29.10 ===> BRUSSELS MAIN EVENT\r\nInternational Party\r\nFREE ENTRANCE\r\n\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\u2583\r\nBRUSSELS PARTY PEOPLE!\r\nJust A Night is going for the first time at ALICE BAR - on Saturday the 29th of October. Join us for another evening of fun, dancing an