te d'\u00e9viter tout ce qui pourrait le confronter \u00e0 ses plus grandes peurs. Mais ce soir, en fermant les yeux, vous embarquerez dans le plus lugubre des voyages. Coinc\u00e9s dans un cauchemar mettant \u00e0 l'honneur l'une de vos phobies, vous n'aurez pas d'autres choix que de surmonter votre peur. Remportez les \u00e9preuves pour obtenir les cl\u00e9s vous menant \u00e0.... un autre cauchemar ! Encore, et encore, et encore, et encore....\r\nInterdit au moins de 16 ans.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/koezio.co\/","email":"brussels@koezio.co","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 319 54 54","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544184"},"nl":{"name":"Bad Dreams - Halloween Koezio","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544184"},"en":{"name":"Bad Dreams - Halloween Koezio","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544184"},"de":{"name":"Bad Dreams - Halloween Koezio","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544184"},"it":{"name":"Bad Dreams - Halloween Koezio","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544184"},"sp":{"name":"Bad Dreams - Halloween Koezio","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544184"},"pt":{"name":"Bad Dreams - Halloween Koezio","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544184"},"cn":{"name":"Bad Dreams - Halloween Koezio","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544184"}},"place":{"id":250130,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Koezio Live Adventure Games","address_street_name":"Boulevard Lambermont","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":"brussels@koezio.co","website":"https:\/\/koezio.co\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 54 53","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard Lambermont, 1","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"KOEZIO, LE PARC INDOOR MULTI-ACTIVIT\u00c9S.   \r\n\r\n Un lieu unique pour renforcer la coh\u00e9sion de groupe !   \r\n\r\n Vous recherchez un espace avec des activit\u00e9s vari\u00e9es et ludiques pour vos collaborateurs ?   \r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\nD\u00e9couvrez nos exp\u00e9riences :  \r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n- Mission des agents d'\u00e9lite : 4 quartiers \u00e0 traverser en \u00e9quipe. Une aventure pour la t\u00eate et les jambes. La garantie d'un grand moment ensemble, m\u00ealant parfaitement actions et \u00e9motions en toute s\u00e9curit\u00e9.  \r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n- VR MAZE : petite activit\u00e9 de r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle. 3 options pour s'immerger dans un autre monde !   \r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n- Karaok\u00e9 Club : un espace haut de gamme, th\u00e9matis\u00e9 et 100% privatis\u00e9 pour des moments de folie avec votre groupe ! Une playlist de 35 000 titres dans tous les styles.    \r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n- Lucky Darts : un jeu de fl\u00e9chettes interactif amusant et accessible \u00e0 tous ! Vous n'avez pas besoin de conna\u00eetre les r\u00e8gles ou de compter les points. Notre technologie s'occupe de tout !   \r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\nVous aurez toujours la possibilit\u00e9 de prendre un verre ou de d\u00e9guster de d\u00e9licieuses tapas ou pizzas avant, pendant ou apr\u00e8s votre activit\u00e9 dans notre bar-restaurant.   \r\n\r\nN'attendez plus et tentez les exp\u00e9riences KOEZIO !  ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Koezio Live Adventure Games","address_street_name":"Lambermontlaan","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":"brussels@koezio.co","website":"https:\/\/koezio.co\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 54 53","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Lambermontlaan, 1","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"KOEZIO, DE INDOORHAL MET VERSCHILLENDE ACTIVITEITEN \r\n\r\nEen unieke plek om de teamgeest aan te wakkeren!  \r\n\r\nOp zoek naar een ruimte met leuke, gevarieerde activiteiten voor je collega's?  \r\n\r\nOntdek de Koezio-ervaringen: \r\n\r\n- Elite Agents Missie: tijdens dit avontuur voor de geest \u00e9n de benen moeten er vier wijken in teams doorkruist worden. Een perfecte mix van acties en emoties om in alle veiligheid beleefd te worden. Plezier gegarandeerd! \r\n\r\n- VR MAZE: korte virtualrealityactiviteit. Kies uit drie opties en dompel je gedurende vijf minuten onder in een andere wereld!  \r\n\r\n- Karaoke Club: deze thematisch ingerichte ruimte is 100 procent priv\u00e9. Je krijgt toegang tot een playlist van 35.000 nummers in alle stijlen. Voor dolle momenten met je groep! \r\n\r\n- Lucky Darts: een interactief dartsspel, leuk en toegankelijk voor iedereen! Je hoeft de regels niet te kennen of de score te tellen. Daarvoor zorgen hun hoogtechnologisch borden!  \r\n\r\nJe hebt altijd de mogelijkheid om voor, tijdens of na je activiteit te genieten van drankjes, heerlijke tapas of pizza's in hun loungy restaurant.  \r\n\r\nWacht niet langer, probeer de Koezio-activiteiten! ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Koezio Live Adventure Games","address_street_name":"Boulevard Lambermont","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":"brussels@koezio.co","website":"https:\/\/koezio.co\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 54 53","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Boulevard Lambermont, 1","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"KOEZIO, THE MULTI-ACTIVITY INDOOR PARK.  \r\n\r\nA unique place to strengthen group cohesion!  \r\n\r\nAre you looking for a space with varied and fun activities for your colleagues?  \r\n\r\nDiscover our experiences: \r\n\r\n- Elite Agents Mission: 4 districts to be crossed in teams. An adventure for the head and legs. The guarantee of a great moment together, perfectly mixing actions and emotions in complete safety. \r\n\r\n- VR MAZE: small virtual reality activity. 3 options to immerse yourself in another world!  \r\n\r\n- Karaoke Club: a top-of-the-range, themed and 100% privatized space for crazy moments with your group! A playlist of 35,000 titles in all styles.   \r\n\r\n- Lucky Darts: an interactive game of darts fun and accessible for everyone! You don\u2019t need to know the rules or to count the score. Our technology takes care of everything!  \r\n\r\nYou will always have the opportunity to grab a drink or enjoy delicious tapas or pizzas before, during or after your activity in our bar-restaurant.  \r\n\r\nDon't wait any longer and try the KOEZIO experiences! ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Koezio Live Adventure Games","address_street_name":"Boulevard Lambermont","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":"brussels@koezio.co","website":"https:\/\/koezio