& museum - Typical caf\u00e9\r\nBordering the Impasses Schuddeveld and Sainte-P\u00e9tronille, you will find one of the favourite places of Brussels citizens: Le th\u00e9\u00e2tre de Toone.\r\nTheater Toone is simultaneously a typical estaminet with its Spanish pink brick walls, blackened beams and tiled floor, a puppet theatre in the attic, with its wooden benches, festooned, multicoloured cushions nailed into the raw wood planks and a puppet museum. There, we find the characters who retired from the stage, these Toone heroes of the past and fetish characters of fellow puppeteers from around the world.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Teatro Real Toone VII","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"6