,"backoffice_id":261422,"import_origin":"explore","sub_type":"other","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1.2599210498949},{"id":541065,"date_start":"2022-10-29","date_end":"2022-10-29","date_next":"2022-10-29","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":true,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"fr":"Concert","nl":"Concert","en":"Concert","de":"Konzert"}},"others":{"list":[4,6],"translations":{"fr":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"nl":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"en":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"de":["Pop, Rock, Jazz...","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Carlou D (S\u00e9n\u00e9gal)","shortdescr":"The king of the Zikr-grooves","longdescr":"Reconnaissable par sa voix claire, Carlou D est un artiste qui combine la musique mystique et spirituelle Zikr des Baye Fall, une communaut\u00e9 soufie du S\u00e9n\u00e9gal, avec les grooves du funk, des \u00e9l\u00e9ments du mbalax s\u00e9n\u00e9galais et de l\u2019afro-pop pour cr\u00e9er un style authentique. Ce m\u00e9lange unique l\u2019a conduit \u00e0 un succ\u00e8s international, puisqu\u2019il a \u00e9t\u00e9 invit\u00e9 dans des festivals tels que Womad, Womex, Africa Festival Hertme, Africa Oye, Glatt & Verkehrt.\r\n\r\nCarlou D, de son vrai nom Ibrahima Loucard, est n\u00e9 dans la banlieue de Dakar, la capitale du S\u00e9n\u00e9gal. Il a commenc\u00e9 sa carri\u00e8re musicale en tant que membre du Positive Black Soul : l\u2019un des groupes de hip-hop les plus c\u00e9l\u00e8bres du pays, et il a \u00e9t\u00e9 soutenu par le l\u00e9gendaire Youssou N\u2019Dour avant de collaborer avec lui. Aujourd\u2019hui il a peut-\u00eatre laiss\u00e9 le hip-hop un peu derri\u00e8re lui, mais il n\u2019en a pas perdu l\u2019esprit : \u00ab La part de hip-hop que j\u2019ai gard\u00e9e dans ma musique, c\u2019est le courage d\u2019\u00eatre direct \u00bb, confie le guitariste, chanteur et danseur d\u2019exception. Profond\u00e9ment enracin\u00e9 dans les rythmes africains, le chanteur et interpr\u00e8te s\u00e9n\u00e9galais \u00e0 succ\u00e8s porte des paroles engag\u00e9es avec une dimension et une extase mystique. Carlou D est ind\u00e9niablement l\u2019un des grands noms du S\u00e9n\u00e9gal contemporain.","performers":"Carlou D: voix, guitare\r\nMouhamadou Doumbouya: percussions\r\nIbrahima Ndir: calebasse\r\nDjiby Diabate: balafon\r\nFabrice Devienne: clavier\r\nVieux Kante Magassa : percussions","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541065"},"nl":{"name":"Carlou D (Senegal)","shortdescr":"De koning van de Zikr-grooves","longdescr":"Met zijn heldere stem verbindt Carlou D de mystieke, spirituele Zikr-muziek van de Baye Fall, een soufi-genootschap uit Senegal, met de grooves van funk, elementen van de Senegales mbalax en afropop om zo zijn eigen, authentieke stijl te cre\u00ebren.  Dat leidde tot internationale successen op festivals als Womad, Womex, Africa Festival Hertme, Africa Oye, Glatt & Verkehrt.\r\n\r\nCarlou D, geboren als Ibrahima Loucard in de buitenwijken van Dakar, de hoofdstad van Senegal, begon zijn muzikale carri\u00e8re als lid van Positive Black Soul: de eerste en misschien wel meest succesvolle hiphopgroep van het land, en werd begeleid door en werkte samen met de legendarische Youssou N\u2019 Dour. Ondertussen mag hij de hiphop wel achter zich hebben gelaten, toch is die nooit helemaal weg \u201cHet deel van hiphop dat ik in mijn muziek heb behouden, is de moed om direct te zijn\u201d, zegt de gitarist, zanger en uitzonderlijke danser. Geworteld in Afrikaanse ritmes brengt de succesvolle Senegalese zanger en performer ge\u00ebngageerde teksten met mystieke extase. E\u00e9n van de topnamen uit Senegal.","performers":"Carlou D: zang, gitaar\r\nMouhamadou Doumbouya: percussie\r\nIbrahima Ndir: kalebas\r\nDjiby Diabate: balafon\r\nFabrice Devienne: klavier\r\nVieux Kante Magassa : percussie","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541065"},"en":{"name":"Carlou D (Senegal)","shortdescr":"The king of the Zikr-grooves","longdescr":"Recognizable by his clear voice, Carlou D is an artist who combines the mystical and spiritual Zikr music of the Baye Fall, a Sufi community in Senegal, with the grooves of funk, elements of Senegalese mbalax and Afro-pop to create an authentic musical style. This unique blend has led him to international success as he has been invited to festivals such as Womad, Womex, Africa Festival Hertme, Africa Oye, Glatt & Verkehrt.\r\n\r\nCarlou D, real name Ibrahima Loucard, was born in the suburbs of Dakar, the capital of Senegal. He started his musical career as a member of Positive Black Soul: one of the most famous hip-hop groups in the country, and he was supported by the legendary Youssou N\u2019Dour before collaborating with him. Today he may have left hip-hop behind him, but he hasn\u2019t lost the spirit of the genre: \u201cThe part of hip-hop that I kept in my music is the courage to be direct\u201d, says the guitarist, singer and dancer. Deeply rooted in African rhythms, the successful Senegalese singer and performer\u2019s repertoire contains songs with engaged lyrics and a mystical dimension. Carlou D is undeniably one of the big names on the contemporary Senegalese music scene.","performers":"Carlou D: vocals, guitar\r\nMouhamadou Doumbouya: percussion\r\nIbrahima Ndir: calabash\r\nDjiby Diabate: balafon\r\nFabrice Devienne: keyboard\r\nOld Kante Magassa: percussion","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541065"},"de":{"name":"Carlou D (S\u00e9n\u00e9gal)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541065"},"it":{"name":"Carlou D (S\u00e9n\u00e9gal)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541065"},"sp":{"name":"Carlou D (S\u00e9n\u00e9gal)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541065"},"pt":{"name":"Carlou D (S\u00e9n\u00e9gal)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541065"},"cn":{"name":"Carlou D (S\u00e9n\u00e9gal)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541065"}},"place":{"id":238099,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Muziekpublique est le centre des musiques traditionnelles du monde de Bruxelles. Etablie dans le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Moli\u00e8re au c\u0153ur du quartier africain, l\u2019asbl organise plus de 100 concerts par an et deux festivals (Hide & Seek Festival etc.). Par ailleurs Muziekpublique propose aussi 50 cours de musique et de danse du monde, comptant plus de 600 \u00e9l\u00e8ves. Ensuite, l\u2019asbl d\u00e9veloppe certains artistes et projets via son label, qui est aussi une agence de booking et de management. La musique traditionnelle a donc trouv\u00e9 un endroit id\u00e9al o\u00f9 se d\u00e9velopper et les artistes y constituent un r\u00e9seau vivant et dynamique cr\u00e9ant des liens de qualit\u00e9 avec le public. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerij van de Naamsepoort","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Galerij van de Naamsepoort, 3","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"Muziekpublique verspreidt en promoot muziek- en danstradities via een ambitieus programma van concerten, cursussen en projecten. Een jaarrond concertprogramma met Belgische en internationale artiesten vormt de kern van de activiteiten van de organisatie. Van contemplatieve tot feestelijke concerten vinden het hele jaar door plaats in het prachtige Moli\u00e8re Theater, aan de Naamsepoort, maar ook op verschillende plaatsen de hoofdstad.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"