s (Halloween Chez Maman)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544513"},"pt":{"name":"La Nuit des Mauvaises (Halloween Chez Maman)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544513"},"cn":{"name":"La Nuit des Mauvaises (Halloween Chez Maman)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544513"}},"place":{"id":242585,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Chez Maman","address_street_name":"Rue des Grands Carmes","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"alain@chezmaman.be","website":"http:\/\/www.chezmaman.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Grands Carmes, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ouvert le 3 d\u00e9cembre 1994, le bar Chez Maman est devenu le cabaret bruxellois de r\u00e9f\u00e9rence pour les spectacles de transformistes. Chaque weekend, Maman et ses filles se produisent sur cette sc\u00e8ne devenue mythique\u2026 Quand on parle de sc\u00e8ne, ici, il faut comprendre \"comptoir\". Car Chez Maman, la sc\u00e8ne, c\u2019est le comptoir de la salle principale. Mais ne dit-on pas que la taille n\u2019a pas d\u2019importance ? Sur ce bout de marbre se d\u00e9roule une magie que des centaines de personnes viennent vivre chaque semaine.\r\nBeaucoup de choses ont chang\u00e9, mais Maman est toujours fid\u00e8le au poste ! Tous les vendredis et samedis, elle se maquille et enfile ses hauts talons... et que la f\u00eate commence ! Elle assure le spectacle aux c\u00f4t\u00e9s de ses filles, fabuleuses, pendant toute la nuit sous les yeux \u00e9bahis de nombreux admirateurs.\r\nNe restez donc pas plantez l\u00e0 ! Et passez du c\u00f4t\u00e9 sauvage de la Force. Franchissez le pas de la porte de l\u2019un des bars gay les plus c\u00e9l\u00e8bres de la capitale et venez admirer un inoubliable spectacle de drag queens qui vous emm\u00e8nera jusqu\u2019au bout de la nuit.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Chez Maman","address_street_name":"Lievevrouwbroersstraat","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"alain@chezmaman.be","website":"http:\/\/www.chezmaman.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Lievevrouwbroersstraat, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Sinds de opening op drie december 1994 is bar-cabaret \u2018Chez Maman\u2019 uitgegroeid tot de Brusselse travestiereferentie bij uitstek. Elk weekend treden Maman en haar dochters op op het mythische podium\u2026 En als we het over een podium hebben, dan bedoelen ze bij Chez Maman eigenlijk de bar. Size doesn\u2019t matter! Op dit stukje marmer gaat elke week voor honderden gasten een magische wereld open, en het feest blijft duren tot in de vroege uurtjes.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Chez Maman","address_street_name":"rue des Grands Carmes","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"alain@chezmaman.be","website":"http:\/\/www.chezmaman.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"rue des Grands Carmes, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Open since 3 December 1994, \u201cChez Maman\u201d has become the drag cabaret par excellence in Brussels. Every weekend, Maman and her girls perform on this mythical stage. When we talk about our stage, we mean bar, because at \u201cChez Maman\u201d, the bar of the main room is our stage. It\u2019s true when they say that size doesn\u2019t matter! Thanks to this tiny marble bar, hundreds of people can come and enjoy the magical experiences that happen at Chez Maman.\r\nMany things have changed, but she is still there! Every Friday and every Saturday, she puts on her make-up and high heels and there she is, alongside her fabulous girls, performing all night long in front of many admirers.\r\nWhat are you waiting for? Take a walk on the wild side. Get in and brace yourself for a fabulous drag show and an unforgettable night in one of the most famous gay bars in Brussels.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Chez Maman","address_street_name":"Rue des Grands Carmes","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"alain@chezmaman.be","website":"http:\/\/www.chezmaman.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Grands Carmes, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Chez Maman","address_street_name":"rue des Grands Carmes","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"alain@chezmaman.be","website":"http:\/\/www.chezmaman.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue des Grands Carmes, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Chez Maman","address_street_name":"rue des Grands Carmes","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"alain@chezmaman.be","website":"http:\/\/www.chezmaman.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Br