-detail.542857"},"nl":{"name":"Vertel & Spel","shortdescr":"Verhalen in het Frans en Nederlands gevolgd door een knutselatelier!","longdescr":"We spitsen onze oren en verwonderen onze ogen voor de mooiste verhaaltjes, \u00e9\u00e9ntje in het Frans en \u00e9\u00e9ntje in het Nederlands! \r\nNadien gaan we samen aan de slag met papier, schaar, lijm en nog zoveel meer om de mooiste creaties te knutselen.","performers":"Nederlandstalige cultduurdienst Sint-Jans-Molenbeek, Nederlandstalige Gemeentelijke bibliotheek \"De Boekenmolen\", Biblioth\u00e8ques communales francophones Molenbeek-Saint-Jean, vzw Multimuzz","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"cultuurbeleid.1080@molenbeek.irisnet.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 412 06 32","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542857"},"en":{"name":"Vertel & Spel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"cultuurbeleid.1080@molenbeek.irisnet.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542857"},"de":{"name":"Vertel & Spel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542857"},"it":{"name":"Vertel & Spel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542857"},"sp":{"name":"Vertel & Spel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542857"},"pt":{"name":"Vertel & Spel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_u